      "content": {
        "title": "AUTO FUNCTION",
        "icon": "/assets/img/content/technology/auto-functions/ico-auto-functions.png",
        "items": [
          {
            "align": "row",
            "context": "For a bathroom to be comfortable, it has to ease the stress of everyday life.<br/><br/>TOTO's NEOREST series does just that with its range of integrated, automatic, sensor-activated functions, including the self-opening and -closing toilet lid, the automatic air purifier and the selfactivating flush.<br/><br/>These auto functions not only provide ease of use and convenience, but also another key benefit:<br/><br/>There's no need to touch the toilet, increasing the level of hygiene in the bathroom.",
            "images": ["/assets/img/content/technology/auto-functions/AUTO LID OPENING AND CLOSING_US 04.jpg"]
          }
        ],
        "youtube": "tqMcyfR4Ddc"
      }
    },
